        // Let me re-read: XBornID() does NOT call distr, it just assigns directly.
        // So need another path. Use getTokens() which calls distr. But getTokens() needs msg.sender not blacklisted.
        // Instead, use distr indirectly: deploy with a user, call getTokens() which calls distr.
